  "description": "■ How to Play\n\nThrow, Merge, and Grow!: Simply drop the \"Yukkuri\" into the bowl! When two of the same kind touch, they transform into a larger Yukkuri!\n\nDon't Let Them Fall!: It's Game Over if the Yukkuri overflow from the bowl...\n\nAim for the High Score!: Growing them large and triggering consecutive merges (Chains) will skyrocket your score!\n\n■ Reimu & Marisa’s Live Commentary!\n\nReimu and Marisa chat away with live-style commentary based on your play!\n\nTheir lively banter and reactions make every match even more exciting!\n\n■ Fully Customisable Features\n\n30 Different Yukkuri!: Play the game, earn points, and head to the shop to unlock new Yukkuri.\n\nCustomise the Evolution Order!: You can swap the order of evolution! Set your favourite character as the largest size and create your very own \"Yukkuri Mountain\"!\n\n■ Various Game Modes\n\nMultiplayer: Supports local matches for up to 4 players! Enjoy a heart-pounding stacking battle together!\n\nRankings: Compete with players worldwide for the top score and prove you’re the ultimate Yukkuri master!",
